OL,3,AGlobal scramble to fix critical
OL,4,Acyber-security flaws as many websites
OL,5,Ataken offline
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Where immediate remediation is not
OL,8,Ffeasible, organisations should consider
OL,9,Ftaking the system offline until it can
OL,10,Fbe fully mitigated," the UK's National
OL,11,FCyber Security Centre says
OL,13,FAmong the impacted sites are Wikipedia,
OL,14,FEdinburgh council, many online stores
OL,15,Fand the BBC
